{"4450050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lemony Fresh", "steam_appid": 4450050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lemony Fresh is a game about <strong>powerwashing</strong>, <strong>traversal</strong>, <strong>adorable friendships</strong>, all with a <strong>tender story</strong> at the core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the carnal satisfaction of <strong>powerwashing grime</strong> with <strong>cleansing lemony goodness</strong>. Roll, bounce, and cling to traverse this intricately trashed house. Rescue your fruity friends who rally with you to restore a broken home from the inside. <strong>Uncover mementos</strong> to remind the family members who live here of what is truly important.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESS YO’SELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lemons are a very expressive species. How you feel like tackling any task is up to you. Why spray when you can <i>ROLL</i>? Why roll when you can <i>BOUNCE?</i> And why bounce when you can <i>drive a bar of soap like a lubed-up RV car?</i> These are the questions that keep me up at night-- please email me if you find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/d420d8e0393a629cede8f5de4c3e45c1.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/d420d8e0393a629cede8f5de4c3e45c1.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/d420d8e0393a629cede8f5de4c3e45c1.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/e5d6803b4cff9202918b23aadd22bc9f.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/e5d6803b4cff9202918b23aadd22bc9f.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/e5d6803b4cff9202918b23aadd22bc9f.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRUIT-FORWARD FRIENDSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every room, you’ll encounter fruits trapped by grime! Spray them back to life and <strong>they join you</strong> to tackle larger cleaning obstacles. <strong>Teamwork makes the gleamwork!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/addfdef922ac395cd683f7c566c011fa.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/addfdef922ac395cd683f7c566c011fa.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/addfdef922ac395cd683f7c566c011fa.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/fd9108569682385a08bd344606f14e59.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/fd9108569682385a08bd344606f14e59.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/fd9108569682385a08bd344606f14e59.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUICY POWERUPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the Suspenders? Boom, you can <u>roll up</u> <u>anything</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the X-Ray Goggles? Bam, you can <u>see dirtiness</u> <u>through walls</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain the Espresso Bean? Zip, you can now <u>ram into anything</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room in this house is chock-full of game-changing mechanics, big and small. Surprises await around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/485b7ccb41c9e8d4cc3d0050425c50d8.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/485b7ccb41c9e8d4cc3d0050425c50d8.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/485b7ccb41c9e8d4cc3d0050425c50d8.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HOUSE TELLS A STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s an elephant in every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To start: Who lives here, and where are they right now? How did this nice home get <i>sooo dirty?</i> And, critically, why did a lemon come to life just to clean it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll gradually come to learn about the residents of this home, who they are, what they want, and what they’ve recently been up to. Every object contributes to a full, tender, and deeply personal story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And gradually, you will understand why you were born to help this family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lemony Fresh is a game about <strong>powerwashing</strong>, <strong>traversal</strong>, <strong>adorable friendships</strong>, all with a <strong>tender story</strong> at the core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the carnal satisfaction of <strong>powerwashing grime</strong> with <strong>cleansing lemony goodness</strong>. Roll, bounce, and cling to traverse this intricately trashed house. Rescue your fruity friends who rally with you to restore a broken home from the inside. <strong>Uncover mementos</strong> to remind the family members who live here of what is truly important.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESS YO’SELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lemons are a very expressive species. How you feel like tackling any task is up to you. Why spray when you can <i>ROLL</i>? Why roll when you can <i>BOUNCE?</i> And why bounce when you can <i>drive a bar of soap like a lubed-up RV car?</i> These are the questions that keep me up at night-- please email me if you find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/d420d8e0393a629cede8f5de4c3e45c1.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/d420d8e0393a629cede8f5de4c3e45c1.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/d420d8e0393a629cede8f5de4c3e45c1.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/e5d6803b4cff9202918b23aadd22bc9f.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/e5d6803b4cff9202918b23aadd22bc9f.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/e5d6803b4cff9202918b23aadd22bc9f.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRUIT-FORWARD FRIENDSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every room, you’ll encounter fruits trapped by grime! Spray them back to life and <strong>they join you</strong> to tackle larger cleaning obstacles. <strong>Teamwork makes the gleamwork!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/addfdef922ac395cd683f7c566c011fa.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/addfdef922ac395cd683f7c566c011fa.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/addfdef922ac395cd683f7c566c011fa.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/fd9108569682385a08bd344606f14e59.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/fd9108569682385a08bd344606f14e59.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/fd9108569682385a08bd344606f14e59.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUICY POWERUPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the Suspenders? Boom, you can <u>roll up</u> <u>anything</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the X-Ray Goggles? Bam, you can <u>see dirtiness</u> <u>through walls</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain the Espresso Bean? Zip, you can now <u>ram into anything</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room in this house is chock-full of game-changing mechanics, big and small. Surprises await around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/485b7ccb41c9e8d4cc3d0050425c50d8.poster.avif?t=1777043905\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/485b7ccb41c9e8d4cc3d0050425c50d8.webm?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/extras/485b7ccb41c9e8d4cc3d0050425c50d8.mp4?t=1777043905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HOUSE TELLS A STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s an elephant in every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To start: Who lives here, and where are they right now? How did this nice home get <i>sooo dirty?</i> And, critically, why did a lemon come to life just to clean it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll gradually come to learn about the residents of this home, who they are, what they want, and what they’ve recently been up to. Every object contributes to a full, tender, and deeply personal story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And gradually, you will understand why you were born to help this family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a tiny lemon who cleans filthy spaces. Explore and restore a home with a warm, beating heart.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450050/2c158801079b4c